{"title":"Online Coffee Social & Meet Your Members - Women Only","startsAt":"2026-10-21T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-21T20:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**Online Coffee Social & Member Meet-Up**\nLooking for a friendly way to connect with other women in the community?\n\nJoin us for our **Online Coffee Social & Member Meet-Up**, a relaxed and welcoming evening designed to help members get to know one another.\nGrab your favorite coffee, tea, or beverage and join us for an hour of conversation, connection, and inspiration.\n\n**Date:** Wednesday Oct 21, 2026\n**Time:** 7:00 PM – 8:00 PM (Zoom)\n\natricia Lavigne is inviting you to a scheduled Zoom meeting.\n\nJoin Zoom Meeting\n[https://us02web.zoom.us/j/81917548078?pwd=RG1PuiegluAyNfFIJVPejbUXP0U3QJ.1](https://www.google.com/url?q=https://us02web.zoom.us/j/81917548078?pwd%3DRG1PuiegluAyNfFIJVPejbUXP0U3QJ.1&sa=D&source=calendar&usd=2&usg=AOvVaw2ePkIn4A1JRuk6r6-ZGaja)\n\nMeeting chat link\n[https://us02web.zoom.us/launch/jc/81917548078](https://www.google.com/url?q=https://us02web.zoom.us/launch/jc/81917548078&sa=D&source=calendar&usd=2&usg=AOvVaw12NKwrly6szZ8OBehA9X1t)\n\nMeeting ID: 819 1754 8078\nPasscode: 660074\n\nWhat to Expect:\n✨ Member introductions\n✨ Icebreaker, trivia , social questions\n✨ Open Q&A for anyone who has questions about the group\n\nWhether you're new to the group or have been with us for a while, this is a wonderful opportunity to build connections, share experiences, and learn more about the opportunities available within our community.\n\n**Who Can Attend?**\nCurrent members and women interested in learning more about the Beyond Change Women's Group.\n\n**Bring:**\n☕ Your favorite beverage\n😊 A positive attitude\n💬 A willingness to connect and have fun\n\nWe look forward to meeting you and spending an enjoyable evening together!\n\n**Empowering Women to Live, Learn, and Love Life.** ❤️\nPatricia Lavigne","venue":{"address":""},"fee":null,"group":"All Fun & Games Social Nights","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/8/1/7/highres_535783031.jpeg"}